      "message": "I\u0027d still prefer this to be a Feature rather than a Toggle, to avoid plumbing through the RequestAdapterOptions here, and to make it symmetrical with ANGLETextureSharing. Is that possible?",
      "revId": "b3a98beb6a61c87bfa78e4ec69dc63ea4447d777",
